[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.51, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "可選的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2171.19, "timestamp": "00:36:11", "text": "物流箱。等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2173.99, "timestamp": "00:36:13", "text": "另一個也有嗎？是啊，物流太糟糕了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2177.51, "timestamp": "00:36:17", "text": "是的，我可以放一些，像是托盤，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2180.95, "timestamp": "00:36:20", "text": "大托盤的建築材料、彈藥、機械"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2184.79, "timestamp": "00:36:24", "text": "用品，或是其他東西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.79, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "石油供應相關事宜。是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2191.67, "timestamp": "00:36:31", "text": "我需要這些托盤。我可以提升我的支援能力和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2196.71, "timestamp": "00:36:36", "text": "飛行能力。  是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2203.91, "timestamp": "00:36:43", "text": "啊，負5000美元。啊。  哦，我透過球員助攻賺了錢。  好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.51, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2212.95, "timestamp": "00:36:52", "text": "我正在閱讀你的評論。我確實讀過你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2218.15, "timestamp": "00:36:58", "text": "好的。還有多遠？好的，我們"}]